OL,3,GNEWSA'We tried to smuggle contraband
OL,4,Ainto Apocalypse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mechanic from Birmingham is one of 14
OL,7,Fpeople who were left with no food or
OL,8,Fwater in an abandoned American town as
OL,9,Fpart of a reality series.
OL,11,FApocalypse, which airs on Channel 4,
OL,12,Fsees two groups of strangers attempt to
OL,13,Fsurvive at a site usually used to train
OL,14,Fthe military and compete for limited
OL,15,Fresources.
OL,17,FLouise Baker, 43, went into the
OL,18,Fchallenge thinking her practical nature
OL,19,Fand DIY skills would have prepared her
OL,20,Ffor the experience, but soon found out
OL,21,Fthis was not the case.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
